      "system": {
        "details": {
          "level": {
            "value": 12
          },
          "publicNotes": "<h2>The Ecstatic — Joy, Creature 12</h2><p>An ecstatic manifestation, competing with Anger to claim the hearts of the party. NOT a demon.</p><p><strong>Contest:</strong> Five rounds. Each PC tracks Happiness 0–5 and Anger 0–5 separately. First to 5: drain exactly 1 Erosion Will once, grant the matching permanent once/day boon. Neither at 5: no reward and no extra Erosion.</p><p><strong>Everything Is Wonderful [two actions]</strong> Will DC 31, one target within 30 ft: CS/S +0, F +1 Happiness, CF +2 Happiness. <strong>Infectious Laughter [one action]</strong> ranged +26 within 30 ft, success +1 Happiness, critical +2. No HP damage.</p><p><strong>Reconciliation:</strong> 3 VP toward helping Joy understand Anger is necessary to defend happiness (Diplomacy/Performance/Occultism DC 31). Requires Anger also at 3 VP; alternative to contest. No permanent death.</p>",
          "privateNotes": "KIRAGON LEIF'S HOPE: these are emotions, NOT demons. They can never be permanently killed; resolve their special win conditions. Damage is narrative/suppression only.",
          "alliance": "opposition"
        },
